MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_Archie::
	.string "ARCHIE: With the RED ORB,\n"
	.string "the sea will be ours! You\l"
	.string "again? No time for a battle.\l"
	.string "TEAM AQUA, move out!$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_ElderTheft::
	.string "The BLUE ORB and RED ORB\n"
	.string "have both been stolen. STERN\l"
	.string "is studying the deep sea.\l"
	.string "Please warn him of this\l"
	.string "danger.$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_EmblemOffer::
	.string "The MAGMA men dropped this\n"
	.string "emblem. Take it. Their trail\l"
	.string "leads back to JAGGED PASS.$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_EmblemDirections::
	.string "The MAGMA EMBLEM marks their\n"
	.string "hideout in JAGGED PASS. Stop\l"
	.string "them before the land and sea\l"
	.string "fall out of balance.$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_EmblemFull::
	.string "There is no room for the\n"
	.string "emblem. Make room, then\l"
	.string "speak to me again.$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_Grunt1Intro::
	.string "TEAM AQUA will claim the\n"
	.string "orb! Your research ends\l"
	.string "here!$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
	.string "Our plan is slipping away!$"

MtPyre_Summit_VS_Text_Grunt1After::
	.string "The boss is at the summit.\n"
	.string "Those orbs hold the power of\l"
	.string "the ancient POKEMON.$"

